<h3><u>Khanjar qareeb</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Khanjar qareeb</u></strong></p>

<p>(Jab mera Hussain, Fatema ka cheyn) x2</p>

<p>Pushte raahwaar se khaak pe ghira</p>

<p>(Ya hussain) x3</p>

<p>Khanjar qareeb, zanu-e-qatil qareeb hai</p>

<p>(Ya hussain) x2</p>

<p>(Khanjar qareeb, zanu-e-qatil qareeb hai, Aaj imtehaan sabr-e-husain-e-ghareeb hai) x2</p>

